00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:14.130
Thank you.

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:19.470
So I think that now, partially thanks to this
Netflix series, The Family, there are more

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:26.770
people who are becoming familiar with the
under the radar way in which Christian nationalism

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:32.410
