00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:20.489
we trust bills which mandate that people put
large in God.

00:02:20.489 --> 00:02:25.840
We trust science in public school classrooms
and public schools, even on public buildings,

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:31.990
even the windows of police cars, just to sort
