00:02:31.990 --> 00:02:38.129
in God we trust this is somehow, you know,
unifying the idea of religion with a national

00:02:38.129 --> 00:02:39.129
identity.

00:02:39.129 --> 00:02:42.569
But, you know, when they these aren't God
