00:02:42.569 --> 00:02:46.470
People think it's sort of a one off and maybe
they oppose it or maybe they don't.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:51.390
But the fact is, these are pieces, a piece
of legislation that are crafted by project

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:52.440
blitz.

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:57.680
And so they understand one thing I'm thinking
